        "author_name": "Michelle Tsend-Ochir",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117299340626499480268/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZZ3drimUyT16RDK-npsoveagG6mO3Nktr80zSUZ8mtmMZUQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We have been using Mathieu's services for about 7 years now.  He is very thorough in his analysis and explanations, knowledgeable, and always takes the time to explain everything, in short, best financial planner we have had.  Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1712272976,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Youri M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108591876345550340093/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIP_efF0QOYP4ZNt_UldfAQKBLCcsnTYztm4xuvYeR19fG6hw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Mathieu is a dedicated, knowledgeable expert in the field of financial planning. Working with him on creating my financial goal was not only easy but very informative. The amount of information/strategies that Mathieu offered will surely be beneficial for my future goals. Looking forward to continue working together.",
        "time": 1673651656,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christine Harvey",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100495467531760612592/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBJmXsdtj3IjG4Gl3qK3c2j3WOG9WC7pdCFYc8ZrZ3t1RFBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Mathieu Leduc has been my financial planner for years. He also helped me with retirement and estate planning. Mathieu is extremely knowledgeable in all aspects of financial planning. He takes the time to answer all my questions and always responds in a timely manner. Mathieu and his team keep a close watch on the market to ensure my assets are performing well.\nI would highly recommend Mathieu Leduc to anyone looking for financial planning, retirement planning and estate planning.\nThank you Mathieu, your support during these strange times is very much appreciated.\nKind regards,\nChristine Harvey",
        "time": 1604081091,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Adam P.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110664941968514190995/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLBq7H1cn5ZGjZeQKxArTDdsG10tOvwdFqvISv69NbVo2E8rQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Mathieu is very professional and trustworthy.  He takes the time that is required to explain things thoroughly. I highly recommend his services to anyone that is looking for an excellent financial planner.",
        "time": 1698432855,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie bonneville",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116545151129166090902/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLFEc8eSNZZM8WWGL2IB8SEfLeTcq3AfUY04z12uIjG4mVUTA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Mr. Leduc took care of my mother's affairs in an efficient way, and now is overseeing my own finances. I am happy to have a \"life-financial-plan\" in place. He is trustworthy, dependable, explains things clearly, and  answers questions patiently.",
